        {
          "path": "_m/t/g/t/5/parsurameswara-temple-wp/bhubaneshwar-ei035.jpg",
          "filename": "Bhubaneshwar ei035.jpg",
          "caption": "Shiva Begs Food from Parvati. South face of tower, Parashurameshvara Temple, Bhubaneshwar\nIn this story from the Puranas, Shiva has neglected his duties\nas a husband by failing to get food for the household. To teach him a lesson, Parvati sends him out naked to beg for food, but again he returns empty-handed. Taking pity, at last she gives him food from her own hands, and so husband and wife are reconciled.",
          "alt": "Shiva Begs Food from Parvati. South face of tower, Parashurameshvara Temple, Bhubaneshwar\nIn this story from the Puranas, Shiva has neglected his duties\nas a husband by failing to get food for the household. To teach him a lesson, Parvati sends him out naked to beg for food, but again he returns empty-handed. Taking pity, at last she gives him food from her own hands, and so husband and wife are reconciled.",
